{"id":27982,"slug":"life-is-sweet","title":"Life Is Sweet","year":1990,"country":"United Kingdom","duration":103,"spine":659,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/27982-life-is-sweet","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/9ada9f93f1489b9d6c049fe18469e34f/2QZP6Njl60900wz5kIoDZ4z1OKKgaq_large.jpg","description":"This invigorating film from Mike Leigh was his first international sensation. Melancholy and funny by turns, it is an intimate portrait of a working-class family in a suburb just north of London—an irrepressible mum and dad (Alison Steadman and Jim Broadbent) and their night-and-day twins, a bookish good girl and a troubled, ill-tempered layabout (Claire Skinner and Jane Horrocks). Leigh and his typically brilliant cast create, with extraordinary sensitivity and craft, a vivid, lived-in story of ordinary existence, in which even modest dreams—such as the father’s desire to open a food truck—carry enormous weight.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Mike Leigh","slug":"mike-leigh"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Jim Broadbent","role":"Andy","slug":"jim-broadbent"},{"actor":"Alison Steadman","role":"Wendy","slug":"alison-steadman"},{"actor":"Claire Skinner","role":"Natalie","slug":"claire-skinner"},{"actor":"Jane Horrocks","role":"Nicola","slug":"jane-horrocks"},{"actor":"Stephen Rea","role":"Patsy","slug":"stephen-rea"},{"actor":"Timothy Spall","role":"Aubrey","slug":"timothy-spall"},{"actor":"David Thewlis","role":"Nicola’s lover","slug":"david-thewlis"},{"actor":"Moya Brady","role":"Paula","slug":"moya-brady"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Mike Leigh","slug":"mike-leigh"},{"role":"Written by","person":"Mike Leigh","slug":"mike-leigh"},{"role":"Produced by","person":"Simon Channing-Williams","slug":null},{"role":"Director of photography","person":"Dick Pope","slug":null},{"role":"Edited by","person":"Jon Gregory","slug":null},{"role":"Music","person":"Rachel Portman","slug":null},{"role":"Production designer","person":"Alison C